    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD Pattern</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Pattern: Fan-out (Push vs Pull)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">When one thing must reach many people - a post, a chat message, a notification - you either do the work when it is written (push) or when it is read (pull). After this page you can pick the right one, explain the celebrity problem, and design the hybrid that real feeds use.</p>\n      "
